{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28468","headline":"寄澧州张舍人笛 · 杜牧","name":"寄澧州张舍人笛","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"髪匀肉好生春岭，截玉钻星寄使君。\n檀的染时痕半月，落梅飘处响穿云。\n楼中威凤倾冠听，沙上惊鸿掠水分。\n遥想紫泥封诏罢，夜深应隔禁墙闻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28468.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28468","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}